  "description": {
    "en": "The Thesaurus of the Geological Survey of Austria is a bilingual (de/en) controlled vocabulary for the semantic harmonisation of geoscientific map-based geodata. Currently there are four thematic subjects available : \r\n\r\n* lithology\r\n* geologic timescale\r\n* geologic units\r\n* tectonic units & classification"
